OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers should 'refuse' to
OL,4,Adrive off if pupils stand up as #1
OL,5,Afares boost numbers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBus drivers should refuse to drive off
OL,8,Fif school children do not sit down in
OL,9,Favailable seats, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FDrivers of public bus services are only
OL,12,Fadvised to ask pupils to sit as there
OL,13,Fis no requirement for passengers to do
OL,14,Fso, unlike dedicated school buses.
OL,16,FConcerns over overcrowded public buses
OL,17,Fhave been raised since schools
OL,18,Freturned, with a photograph shared
OL,19,Fonline showing pupils standing in a
OL,20,Fcrowded aisle while on a Newport Bus
OL,21,Fservice to Monmouth.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
